1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,200
Lower the baton, Alex.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,200
How do you know my name?

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,200
We run. Right now.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,200
No. Not until he talks.

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:18,000
The safe zone is a lie.

6
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:21,000
Then who sent the signal?

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Hold still. You're bleeding.

8
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:27,070
Who are you?

9
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:29,630
Luna. I heard the radio too.

10
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:33,500
You've been hiding here since Day One?

11
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,560
Someone had to keep the door locked.

12
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,500
They followed your light.

13
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:43,200
The door won't hold them.

14
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:48,200
There's a tunnel. Under the floor.

15
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:52,030
Then we go. Together.

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,900
Down. Quick. Before—

17
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,850
Shadow... the trap is set. Bring them to the safe zone.
